{
 "duration": 23.477,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Light snow at the trailhead. Kai didn't think twice.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 3.325
  },
  {
   "text": "But wet snow kept landing on his pack and melting.",
   "start": 4.125,
   "end": 6.847
  },
  {
   "text": "By the top, his spare layer was damp and his snacks were soggy.",
   "start": 7.647,
   "end": 11.141
  },
  {
   "text": "The fix was already on his pack.",
   "start": 11.941,
   "end": 13.547
  },
  {
   "text": "A rain cover, tucked in its own pocket.",
   "start": 14.347,
   "end": 16.494
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirty seconds, and the pack stayed dry for the rest of the hike.",
   "start": 17.294,
   "end": 20.584
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next snowy hike.",
   "start": 21.384,
   "end": 23.277
  }
 ],
